{"id":40553,"date":"2025-02-16T19:37:34","date_gmt":"2025-02-16T18:37:34","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sousoes-trail-2025\/"},"modified":"2026-08-23T23:22:28","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T22:22:28","slug":"sousoes-trail-2025","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sousoes-trail-2025\/","title":{"rendered":"Sous\u00f5es Trail 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Sous\u00f5es, linhagem de nobreza medieval portuguesa associada ao esfor\u00e7o guerreiro, \u00e0 conquista e funda\u00e7\u00e3o da nacionalidade, detentora de um vasto patrim\u00f3nio territorial centrado na regi\u00e3o do Entre-Douro-e-Minho.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O registo da hist\u00f3ria coloca Felgueiras como palco de atua\u00e7\u00e3o dos Sous\u00f5es, intimamente ligada \u00e0 g\u00e9nese e aos primeiros passos do jovem reino portugu\u00eas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">O Sous\u00f5es Trail \u2013 Felgueiras, realiza a sua 3\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o, no dia 26 de outubro, com passagem pelo Vale do Bugio e Ferro, com vista \u00e0 realiza\u00e7\u00e3o de percursos de Trail (26km), sprint\/jovem (17km) e caminhada (10km), percorrendo trilhos florestais e caminhos do concelho de Felgueiras.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es est\u00e3o abertas a todos os amantes deste desporto e outros interessados que sintam vontade de participar neste desafio.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A participa\u00e7\u00e3o inclui seguro, refor\u00e7os alimentares, t-shirt, pr\u00e9mio finisher, pr\u00e9mios finais, banhos e outras ofertas.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Atreve-te a participar num trilho com identidade!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n\n\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":44215,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[24,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-40553","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-felgueiras-porto","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-porto","event_type_2-porto-e-norte"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/521581728_1394771555525704_8225209826432714023_n-1-1024x389.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/40553","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=40553"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/40553\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":62307,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/40553\/revisions\/62307"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/44215"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=40553"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=40553"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=40553"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=40553"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3"